# AI Resume Screening System

An AI-based resume screening system that uses Natural Language Processing and Machine Learning to extract resume content, identify resume sections, validate document structure, and classify sections such as Skills, Education, Projects, Work Experience, and Certifications.

## Technologies

- Python
- Natural Language Processing (NLP)
- Sentence Transformers
- Logistic Regression
- Scikit-learn
- PyMuPDF
- Tesseract OCR
- Streamlit

## Project Features

- Resume text extraction
- Resume section identification
- Section classification using Machine Learning
- Confidence-aware classification
- Resume structure validation
- Streamlit-based application interface
